      r_o = c_x if adj_x else r_x
      c_o = r_y if adj_y else c_y

  It is computed as:

      output[..., :, :] = matrix(x[..., :, :]) * matrix(y[..., :, :])

  *NOTE*: `BatchMatMulV3` supports broadcasting in the batch dimensions. More
  about broadcasting
